OL,3,AHouthis warn airlines and passengers
OL,4,Anot to use Saudi Arabian airports after
OL,5,Adeadly Riyadh attack
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour Saudis, two people from Bangladesh
OL,8,Fand one person each from the US,
OL,9,FJordan, Palestine, Syria, Sudan and
OL,10,FEgypt were killed, the Saudi civil
OL,11,Faviation authority says
OL,13,F"Everyone was running," an eyewitness
OL,14,Fwho was at the airport says - video
OL,15,Ffootage shows smoke rising after the
OL,16,Fattack
